flowchart LR
  System[System authority] --> Developer[Developer authority]
  Developer --> User[User intent and constraints]
  Safety[Safety and platform boundary] --> Decision[Authorized decision]
  System --> Decision
  Developer --> Decision
  User --> Decision
  Decision --> Internal[Internal responsibility model]
  Internal --> Route[Route selection]
  Internal --> Stop[Block / stop]
  Internal --> Delivery[Delivery recommendation]
  Conflict[Conflict] --> Precedence[External precedence and escalation]
  Precedence --> Decision
